==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} ''[[tabac]] [[râpé]]'' "[[grate]]d [[tobacco]]", [[Appendix:Glossary#past participle|past participle]] of ''[[râper]]'' "to grate", from {{etyl|fro|en}} ''rasper'' "to [[scrape]]"; of [[Germanic]] origin.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

